# Keeps the build context small and the image reproducible. Anything listed
# here is either reinstalled, regenerated or has no business in an image.
#
# Note what is *not* here: the source of apps/web and apps/mobile. Neither is
# installed or run, but `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` reads every importer
# in the lockfile, and dropping a workspace package fails the install. A few
# megabytes of unused source is the cheaper trade.

**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Rebuilt or regenerated in the image
**/dist
**/build
packages/db/src/generated

# Caches
**/.turbo
**/.tanstack
**/.expo
**/.vite
coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Not part of the runtime
.git
.github
docs
README.md
biome.json
**/*.log

# Secrets never enter an image; the platform supplies the environment.
.env
.env.*
